meta {
  name: Events - Set state - Refused change
  type: http
  seq: 192
}

put {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of an events space>/events/<cuid of an event>/state
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "state": "draft"
  }
}

docs {
  Error case: a published event that started cannot go back to draft: 422, "An event that started cannot go back to draft. Cancel it instead." A published event that a member answered cannot go back to draft either: 422, "Members answered this event. Cancel it instead." (#1515). A draft cannot be cancelled (422) and a cancelled event cannot go back to draft (422).
}
